# EvANotes Visual Audit Checklist

- [x] Navigate to http://localhost:5173
- [ ] Confirm Logo icon (32px, sharp) - **FAIL: Logo SVG is 1556px, pushing content down.**
- [ ] Verify "Yeni Görev" button (icon small, aligned) - **PASS: Icon is 24px, alignment okay.**
- [ ] Confirm Stats cards (spacing between label and number) - **FAIL: Label and number are touching (no space).**
- [ ] Verify task items (circles/checkmarks sized correctly) - **PASS: Size is 24px (standard).**
- [ ] Capture final "Perfect" screenshot

## Findings
- **Logo**: The main SVG at the top is massive (1556px) and lacks proper sizing constraints. It is pushing the rest of the UI down.
- **Stats**: The stats labels and numbers are rendered together as `Tamamlanan12` without any space.
- **Header**: The header text "EvANotes" is visible but displaced by the oversized SVG.
- **Button**: The "Yeni Görev" button looks okay, but the icon is 24px (standard) instead of "small" (e.g. 16/20px) depending on definition.
